  MISS -> REMEMBER -> GO
  BUT SEE FIRST FRAME
  When it sees first frame, then it remembers ok its here then maybe at frame n because of obstacle avoidance it will go beyond the fov then i will have a 
  "belief" that it was there then my policy will resteer it back



